# This repository is public (GitHub Pages user site): only code is tracked.
# Docs, personal content, design files and media stay local or live in the
# private content repo (trey-lm-content), which CI checks out at build time.

# --- Non-code folders
/docs/
/content/
/design/canvas/
/design/previews/
/design/skyline/out/
/design/background/site/
/web/public/replays/
/web/public/content/

# --- Generated model data (derived from Llama weights or calibration runs; never published)
/api/data/
*.npy
*.npz
*.safetensors
*.gguf

# --- Non-code files, anywhere in the tree
*.md
!/README.md
*.markdown
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
